    "\$f''(x) = 4 \\left(3 x^{2} - 1\\right)\$. Setting \$f''(x) > 0\$ gives \$\\left(-\\infty, - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right) \\cup \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}, \\infty\\right)\$.",
