    "With \$n=4\$ rectangles on \$[0,2]\$, each has width \$\\Delta x = \\dfrac{1}{2}\$, and right endpoints \$x_k = \\dfrac{k}{2}\$ for \$k=1,2,3,4\$. The sum is \$\\sum_{k=1}^{4} \\left(\\dfrac{k}{2}\\right)^{2} \\cdot \\dfrac{1}{2} = \\dfrac{1}{8}(1+4+9+16) = \\dfrac{30}{8} = \\dfrac{15}{4}\$.",
    "With \$u = 2 x + 1\$, \$du = 2 \\, dx\$. \$\\int \\dfrac{2}{2 x + 1} \\, dx = \\int \\dfrac{1}{u} \\, du = \\ln|u| + C = \\ln|2 x + 1| + C\$.",
    "With \$u = 5 x\$, \$du = 5 \\, dx\$. \$\\int e^{5 x} \\, dx = \\dfrac{1}{5} \\int e^u \\, du = \\dfrac{1}{5} e^u + C = \\dfrac{1}{5} e^{5 x} + C\$.",
    "With \$u = x\$ and \$dv = \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} \\, dx\$: \$du = dx\$ and \$v = \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}\$. Integration by parts, \$\\int u \\, dv = uv - \\int v \\, du\$, gives \$\\int x \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} \\, dx = x\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} - \\int \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\, dx = x \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} + C\$.",
    "With \$u = x\$ and \$dv = \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\, dx\$: \$du = dx\$ and \$v = - \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\$. Integration by parts, \$\\int u \\, dv = uv - \\int v \\, du\$, gives \$\\int x \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\, dx = x- \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} - \\int - \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} \\, dx = - x \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} + \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + C\$.",
    "With \$u = x\$ and \$dv = e^{x} \\, dx\$: \$du = dx\$ and \$v = e^{x}\$. Integration by parts, \$\\int u \\, dv = uv - \\int v \\, du\$, gives \$\\int x e^{x} \\, dx = xe^{x} - \\int e^{x} \\, dx = \\left(x - 1\\right) e^{x} + C\$.",
    "With \$u = x\$, \$du = 1 \\, dx\$. \$\\int \\dfrac{1}{x} \\, dx = \\int \\dfrac{1}{u} \\, du = \\ln|u| + C = \\ln|x| + C\$.",
